---
// Starlight's ThemeProvider override. The site is light only, so the page
// always uses the light theme, also when the operating system or a stored
// choice asks for dark. The script is inline so that it runs before the page
// paints. Without JavaScript, the theme in styles/starlight keeps the light
// colours.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "light";
</script>
